```
      // Emit one failing instance so the family is counted even if it has no reports
      if (contact.contact && contact.contact.type === 'clinic') {
        emit(Object.assign({}, original, {
          _id: familyId,
          date: Date.now(),
          pass: false,
        }));
```

The target emits 1 `pass: true` instance for each home visit + 1 `pass: false` instance for each family to ensure it is counted properly in the denominator.

