I'm interested to see what else is in `uhcStats` - it's a fairly specific namespace - we might consider something more generic given that it isn't convenient to have many global inputs. So you might consider something more generic like `contactStats` (general) or `contact.uhcStats` (specific but avoids new global). I dunno.

